{"id":43546,"date":"2026-02-17T16:41:05","date_gmt":"2026-02-17T16:41:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/rednoticetrack.com\/?post_type=services&#038;p=43546"},"modified":"2026-06-04T14:23:54","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T14:23:54","slug":"interpol-access-request","status":"publish","type":"services","link":"https:\/\/rednoticetrack.com\/services\/interpol-access-request\/","title":{"rendered":"INTERPOL Access Request"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"43546\" class=\"elementor elementor-43546\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9592c28 e-con-full e-flex cmsmasters-block-default e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9592c28\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20fe663 e-con-full e-flex cmsmasters-block-default e-con e-child\" data-id=\"20fe663\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-905219c cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"905219c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>INTERPOL Access Request<\/b><br>Notice Status Check<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f086cb elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1f086cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Not all INTERPOL. An INTERPOL CCF Access Request allows individuals to determine whether their personal data is processed in INTERPOL\u2019s databases. Through the Commission for the Control of INTERPOL\u2019s Files (&#8220;CCF&#8221;), you can request confirmation of whether your name appears in INTERPOL systems, including possible Red Notices,\u00a0 or other INTERPOL notices. Konstantina Zivla assists clients in preparing compliant Access Requests and managing the submission process confidentially.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a9bec8 elementor-align-center cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"5a9bec8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/447377993356\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Submit Access Request<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a3fcf9 elementor-align-center cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"6a3fcf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Schedule Consultation<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36d7c69 e-con-full e-flex cmsmasters-block-default e-con e-child\" data-id=\"36d7c69\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d7396b cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d7396b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>What is an INTERPOL CCF Access Request?<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0e823a cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c0e823a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1290\">An INTERPOL access request is a formal procedure that allows individuals to verify whether their personal data is stored or processed within INTERPOL\u2019s information systems. This request is submitted to the Commission for the Control of INTERPOL\u2019s Files, the independent body responsible for overseeing the lawfulness of data processed by INTERPOL.<\/p><p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1548\">Through this procedure, individuals may obtain confirmation regarding:<\/p><p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1548\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><strong>a)<\/strong> Whether their personal data exists in INTERPOL systems<\/span><\/p><p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1548\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><strong>b)<\/strong> Whether an INTERPOL Notice or diffusion may be associated with their identity<\/span><\/p><p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1548\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><strong>c)<\/strong> Whether further action (such as correction or deletion requests) may be appropriate<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c703879 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c703879\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Why do people submit Access Requests to CCF?<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9474d4a cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9474d4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1935\">People often submit an INTERPOL Access Request when they:<\/p><ul data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2265\"><li data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1992\"><p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1992\">Were stopped or questioned at an international border<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"><p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2025\">Were denied entry to a country<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"><p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2070\">Suspect a possible INTERPOL Red Notice<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2126\"><p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2126\">Have an outstanding arrest warrant in another country<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2193\"><p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2193\">Need to verify their status for immigration, business, or travel<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2265\"><p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2265\">Want to ensure they are not mistakenly listed due to a name match<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dbe029d cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dbe029d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>What Information the CCF May Provide<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26bfffb cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"26bfffb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The CCF may confirm whether INTERPOL is processing personal data relating to you. Depending on the circumstances and applicable rules, the response may include:<\/p><p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2544\"><strong>a)<\/strong> Confirmation that no data is recorded.<\/p><p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2544\"><strong>b)<\/strong> Confirmation that data exist, together with information regarding the requesting National Central Bureau and the legal basis for the notice or diffusion.<\/p><p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2544\"><strong>c)<\/strong> Confirmation that checks have been carried out, but that the source country has restricted access to the information, preventing the CCF from disclosing further details.<\/p><p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2652\">As INTERPOL data originate from its member countries, certain information may remain confidential in accordance with applicable rules and restrictions imposed by the requesting state.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-945770e cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"945770e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>INTERPOL CCF Process<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b925e0 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7b925e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3385\"><strong>Step 1: Information Review<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3450\">Your identity details and supporting documentation are reviewed.<\/p><p data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3491\"><strong>Step 2: Preparation of CCF Request<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3573\">The Access Request is drafted in accordance with CCF procedural requirements.<\/p><p data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3610\"><strong>Step 3: Submission to INTERPOL<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3694\">The request is submitted to the Commission for the Control of INTERPOL\u2019s Files.<\/p><p data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3722\"><strong>Step 4: Review by CCF<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3792\">The Commission checks whether all the required documents have been submitted. If so, it finds the request admissible.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p><p data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3824\"><strong>Step 5: Official Response<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3905\">If the request is admissible, CCF checks INTERPOL\u2019s databases and provides a formal response regarding the existence of any relevant data.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1473dec cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1473dec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Frequently Asked Questions<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42a6bfa cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"42a6bfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>1. Can I check If I have an INTERPOL Red Notice?<\/b><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5524ce0 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5524ce0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4555\">Yes, an Access Request to the CCF allows you to determine whether INTERPOL holds data related to your identity.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7ce075 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b7ce075\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>2. <\/b><strong data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4597\">Can anyone submit an Access Request?<\/strong><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b611480 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b611480\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4684\">Yes. Any individual may request access to their personal data processed by INTERPOL.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1929553 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1929553\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>3. Does an Access Request remove a Red Notice?<\/b><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a097546 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a097546\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4686\" data-end=\"4848\">No. An Access Request only determines whether data exists. A separate procedure is required to request deletion (<a href=\"https:\/\/rednoticetrack.com\/services\/interpol-deletion-request\/\">Deletion Request<\/a>).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b91da7 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9b91da7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>4. <\/b><strong data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4912\">Will INTERPOL disclose the country that issued the notice?<\/strong><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75b2dfe cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"75b2dfe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4976\">In most cases, CCF discloses the country that requested the issuance of the notice. However, disclosure may be limited depending on confidentiality rules imposed by the requesting country.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70a152f cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"70a152f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><strong data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5032\">5. What if my name is same to someone on an INTERPOL Notice?<\/strong><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06eb98e cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"06eb98e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4976\">This is rare, but the CCF can determine whether the data actually relates to you or another individual with the same name.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1084a96 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1084a96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Confidentiality and Data Protection<\/b><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c38ac6a cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c38ac6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4976\">All information submitted through this form is treated as <strong data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5322\"><u>strictly confidential<\/u><\/strong>.\u00a0<\/p><p data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4976\">Personal data is used solely for the purpose of preparing and submitting an <span data-start=\"5402\" data-end=\"5433\">INTERPOL CCF Access Request<\/span>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16025d1 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"16025d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Access Request<\/b><br>Information Form<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7afee5 cmsmasters-block-default cmsmasters-sticky-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a7afee5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you have any questions regarding 